226 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Sometimes leadership needs a\240mirror of the debate\054 not a pre\055written verdict\056\n\nDeliberative AI\240reveals the\240contours of the argument\054 helping execs practice scenario\055thinking and internal dialectics\056\nSynthesis AI\240builds\240narrative velocity\054 guiding decisions by aligning trade\055offs into a path forward\056\n\nThis is a tension between\240cognitive expansion and cognitive convergence\056\n\050The deliberative mode slows you down to see complexity\056 The synthesis mode speeds you up to act with confidence\056 Knowing\240when\240to switch between them is what makes great strategy conversational\054 not just computational\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 227 0 R
     /Pg 220 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
